        "original_id": "fa855428-aead-5601-9945-b762f1389cd5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Dias De Garage\n- Projects: Listen Without Distraction\n- People: Josh Homme, John Garcia, Brant Bjork, Chris Cockrell\n- Organizations: Kyuss\n- Places: Palm Desert, California\n\nFacts:\n- Kyuss was an American rock band formed in 1987 in Palm Desert, California.\n- Kyuss was formed by Josh Homme on guitar, John Garcia on vocals, Brant Bjork on drums, and Chris Cockrell on bass.\n- Dias De Garage released the first-ever tribute to Kyuss in July 2004.\n- The tribute collection was titled \"Listen Without Distraction.\"\n- Listen Without Distraction was named after instructions that Kyuss used to give music fans on their albums.",
